# Copy to .env for local production builds (`pnpm build`, `pnpm verify`); on Cloudflare Pages and in CI this comes from
# the environment, which wins over this file. `ng serve` and `ng test` do not read it: they use http://localhost:3000.
# Must be https:// (the site is served over HTTPS). Read by scripts/build.ts.
